The "Martial Arts Video Analysis" program will help to optimize the process of analyzing the competitive activity of combat athletes of various qualifications (all types of Martial Arts).

FEATURES:
* Recording the names of main actions that, according to the expert, should be used in the analysis of fights.
* Video management. Short press on "Play Video" / "Stop Video" screen. Playback, step by step viewing forward, backward (step length can be set in the settings). A long press on the screen opens / closes the side menu (the color of the box can be set in the settings).
* Time indicators. To view a list of individual technical actions and their timing. 
* Viewing and editing the list of actions.
* Assessment of action.
* Edit project. Editing a project is possible if there is a corresponding video in the device library. After making the changes, you need to save the project. In edit mode, when clicking on any action (Actions) that particular episode will consequently appear. Swipe to the right will allow you to edit the points earned. Work on the project can be stopped and continued at any time.
* View a screenshot of the action.
* Report №1. It provides general information about the competitive activity of combat athletes. It is recommended to use it when analyzing a series of fights of different athletes.
	The report states:
- total number of actions;
- the number of points scored;
- the effectiveness of the entire fight;
- the effectiveness of the fight at the beginning, in the middle, at the end;
- interval between actions;
- variety of actions.
* Report №2. It provides information about the effective competitive actions of combat athletes in one or several fights. It is recommended to use it when analyzing a series of fights of different athletes.
	The report states (in terms of one round, on average per round):
- action names;
- total number of actions;
- the number of points scored;
- effectiveness of actions.  
* Report №3. It provides information about one competitive fight. It is recommended to use it when analyzing a competitive battle consisting of several rounds (fights).
	The report states (for each round (fight) separately):
- total number of actions;
- the number of points scored;
- effectiveness of actions.
* Share (for all reports) - a report in CSV format (you can open it with Numbers).
* Backup. In this section, you can create a new backup, share it with other users (swipe to the right) or save it on the device in the system folder "Files", and also delete the selected copy (swipe to the left).

Avec Bescherelle – L’Art de conjuguer, plus besoin de chercher, trouvez tout de suite la conjugaison complète de n’importe quel verbe ! Le moteur de recherche puissant et intuitif vous permet d’accéder au tableau d’un verbe à partir de n’importe quelle forme conjuguée, qu’elle soit bien ou mal orthographiée. Vous pourrez aussi faire toute la lumière sur la nouvelle orthographe en accédant en un instant aux formes rectifiées des verbes.  Conçu avec la rigueur qui caractérise les ouvrages de la collection « Bescherelle », cet outil efficace et facile à utiliser vous aidera à maîtriser la conjugaison française.

Disponible sur iPad et iPhone, cette application propose :
- les tableaux de conjugaison de 10 037 verbes en orthographe traditionnelle ;
- les tableaux de conjugaison de 10 016 verbes en orthographe rectifiée ;
- un moteur de recherche performant qui permet de trouver le tableau d’un verbe à partir de n’importe quelle forme de sa conjugaison, même si l’on fait une faute de frappe ou d’orthographe ;
- des tableaux clairs qui présentent les temps simples sur une page et les temps composés sur une autre ;
- la possibilité de visualiser instantanément la forme passive des verbes ;
- la possibilité de passer instantanément de l’orthographe traditionnelle à l’orthographe rectifiée.
